<title>SWITZERLAND: Roche non-operating profit jumps 21 pct.</title>
<headline>Roche non-operating profit jumps 21 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BASLE, Switzerland 1997-04-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calender 1996:</p>
<p>				    (million Sfr unless stated)</p>
<p> Non-operating income, net  1,289	     vs 1,065</p>
<p> Group operating profit     3,420	     vs 3,057</p>
<p> Group net profit	     3,899	     vs 3,372</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit		 4,709	     vs 4,122</p>
<p> Taxes			    758		 vs 690</p>
<p> Gross profit		   11,077	    vs 10,172</p>
<p> Marketing, distribution    3,931	     vs 3,601</p>
<p> Research and development   2,446	     vs 2,290</p>
<p> Administration		 791		 vs 814</p>
<p>Other operating income,</p>
<p> expenses, net		  489 loss	  vs 410 loss</p>
<p> Sales			    15,966	    vs 14,722</p>
<p> Cost of sales		  4,889	     vs 4,550</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name is Roche Holding AG. The profit and loss account was contained in Roche's 1996 annual report.</p>
<p>--  Zurich Editorial +41 1 631 7340</p>
</text>
